cities.json and boundaries.parquet in this folder are a database derived from the
Overture Maps divisions theme. They are made available under the Open Database
License (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the
Database Contents License: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

(c) OpenStreetMap contributors, Overture Maps Foundation.
Source: Overture Maps Foundation, overturemaps.org, divisions theme. Other
sources in that theme: geoBoundaries, Esri Community Maps contributors and Land
Information New Zealand (LINZ), each under CC BY 4.0.

Changes made: cities were selected by the rule in cities.py, boundary polygons
were simplified to about 20 m, and cities without a usable polygon were given a
circle around their centre point.
